# Needs the dev test stock (TST). Trades 10 TST and places sell orders but advances no days
# (nothing fills); cleanup cancels them and sells back.
name every Your Portfolio order card shows its whole detail line (long prices, trailing stop) clear of its Cancel button
# the game's own Investments lists, whatever the "Investments list and research" flag says
investments-list off
set-price TST 100
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
click Button
wait 1
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-TakeProfitSell
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1000000
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 10 shares if the price rises to ₡1,000,000
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderCancel-$order
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 99
click Button
expect-orders-delta 2
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 10 shares if the price drops to ₡99
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderCancel-$order
show-sell TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-TrailingStopSell
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 15
click Button
expect-orders-delta 3
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 10 shares, 15% trail, stop ₡85
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderCancel-$order
capture portfolio-order-detail-cards
cleanup:
investments-list restore
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 10
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
close-economy
